cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: Immune Cytometry Report
abstract: The last step of both immune cytometry workflows. Reads whatever upstream outputs it is given
  and writes one offline HTML report covering study design, QC, populations, differential abundance and
  state, batch effects before and after correction, and methods with versions, parameters and citations.
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-cytometry-report
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- cytometry
- flow-cytometry
- report
- differential-abundance
- batch-effects
